# Generated overview pages. Deliberately NOT tracked here.
#
# These render an honest read of what each connector has proven, including what it has not — which is
# the right thing for delivery to see before scoping an implementation, and the wrong thing to expose
# on a public URL. This repo is public, so anything committed here is public whether or not a Pages
# site points at it. The pages are built and served from MemberJunction/integrations-overview
# (`internal` visibility) instead; that repo checks this one out and runs the generator.
#
# Run `node scripts/build-overview-docs.mjs` locally whenever you want them — they just stay untracked.
docs/index.html
docs/marketing.html
docs/technical.html
docs/.nojekyll
